{"id":"2193593015","kind":"answer","title":"从Anki过渡到Supermemo需要注意些什么呢？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"间隔重复 & 注意力管理","date":"2021-10-28","updated":"2021-10-28","votes":110,"comment_count":20,"minutes":4,"chars":1867,"keywords":["间隔重复","SuperMemo","渐进阅读","助记媒介","Piotr Wozniak"],"summary":"我就从操作角度和理念角度分别回答一下吧。内容比较零散，大家看可以根据目录挑自己感兴趣的看即可。 操作角度 学习入口：牌组 vs 队列 在 Anki 中学习，需要从一个牌组开始，如果需要多个牌组混合学习，必须使用 筛选牌组 或 多层牌组 。 在这种设置下，一次学习一套牌组，无形之中成为了默认选项。 而 SuperMemo，一打开…","question_detail_html":"<p>使用Anki3年了，最近想转用SuperMemo应该注意些什么呢</p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/495036699/answer/2193593015","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"操作角度"},{"id":"sec-2","level":3,"title":"学习入口：牌组 vs 队列"},{"id":"sec-3","level":3,"title":"当日学习：学习阶段 vs 巩固练习"},{"id":"sec-4","level":3,"title":"算法参数：自由调整 vs 独裁控制"},{"id":"sec-5","level":3,"title":"卡片来源：批量制卡 vs 渐进阅读"},{"id":"sec-6","level":3,"title":"杂项"},{"id":"sec-7","level":2,"title":"理念角度"},{"id":"sec-8","level":3,"title":"复习工具 vs 学习工具"},{"id":"sec-9","level":3,"title":"颜值万岁 vs 实用主义"},{"id":"sec-10","level":3,"title":"填鸭式 vs 自助餐"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"jI6MIC_s\">我就从操作角度和理念角度分别回答一下吧。内容比较零散，大家看可以根据目录挑自己感兴趣的看即可。</p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">操作角度</h2><h3 id=\"sec-2\">学习入口：牌组 vs 队列</h3><p data-pid=\"XhW9HU7J\">在 Anki 中学习，需要从一个牌组开始，如果需要多个牌组混合学习，必须使用<b>筛选牌组</b>或<b>多层牌组</b>。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-3736f4c03dd38eeef790c682316d062c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-b633134127aef162348cf998acb6c40c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-b633134127aef162348cf998acb6c40c_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"667\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-3736f4c03dd38eeef790c682316d062c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-b633134127aef162348cf998acb6c40c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-b633134127aef162348cf998acb6c40c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"667\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"qX5yjRy3\">在这种设置下，一次学习一套牌组，无形之中成为了默认选项。</p><p data-pid=\"wg1SxHmd\">而 SuperMemo，一打开就进入了学习队列，默认将所有卡片混合在一起：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-434311a94d3918a75ac0248de16035c2_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-47a45fd746c07a7ec8db2a03a974e4f5\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-47a45fd746c07a7ec8db2a03a974e4f5_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1139\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-434311a94d3918a75ac0248de16035c2_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-47a45fd746c07a7ec8db2a03a974e4f5\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-47a45fd746c07a7ec8db2a03a974e4f5_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1139\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"5OgVN4T5\">想要在 SuperMemo 中实现 Anki 那样一个牌组一个牌组学习，反而要借助<b>筛选组学习</b>。在这种设置下，穿插各个学科进行学习才是常态。</p><p data-pid=\"whfkQODf\">哪一种更好？请参阅：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"-MS_e7Oc\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/57139724\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">【理论】穿插练习——「乱」中取胜的秘密</a></li><li data-pid=\"NU8-vzth\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"322584755\" href=\"#/post/322584755\">【翻译】SuperMemo 中渐进阅读的意义：第二部分</a></li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-3\">当日学习：学习阶段 vs 巩固练习</h3><p data-pid=\"aGV4m1bJ\">在 Anki 中，一张卡片常常会在<b>一天之内</b>多次出现。Anki 通过设置<b>学习阶段</b>和<b>重新学习阶段</b>来控制一天之内卡片出现的次数与间隔。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-17e04c21c8c4844e462c53acbfac784e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-112f5526c50da3cbdbbf136dc32703de\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-112f5526c50da3cbdbbf136dc32703de_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"736\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-17e04c21c8c4844e462c53acbfac784e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-112f5526c50da3cbdbbf136dc32703de\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-112f5526c50da3cbdbbf136dc32703de_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"736\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"ylroLU-j\">Anki 的算法花了很大力气在优化这上面，此外还有各种学习顺序的设置。</p><p data-pid=\"7M-JhvSX\">而 SuperMemo，则只用一个<b>巩固练习</b>来实现当日多次学习。并且 woz<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>不推荐滥用该功能。</p><blockquote data-pid=\"Ip1SaL4n\">巩固练习是学习完每日的学习任务之后进行的一个补充学习过程。<br/><br/>连续两次得分低于4分的卡片会被加入到巩固练习队列，除非他们得到更高的分数（4分或者5分），否则会一直在巩固练习队列出现。<br/><br/>来源：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.yuque.com/supermemo/wiki/final_drill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Final drill 巩固练习 最终演练 最终练习 · 语雀 (yuque.com)</a></blockquote><p data-pid=\"4TIVbbT0\">哪一种更好？请参阅：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"hE7XM-3J\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"360416156\" href=\"#/post/360416156\">死记硬背（填鸭式学习）</a></li><li data-pid=\"g52He6Qq\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"279166945\" href=\"#/post/279166945\">间隔效应</a></li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-4\">算法参数：自由调整 vs 独裁控制</h3><p data-pid=\"ZLfypSbq\">Anki 的算法参数实在是太自由辣：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-9c81f8aa21447a8855612d5ffdfd67a3_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-02d7f29a3fc6c996e2b222d5581c53a0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-02d7f29a3fc6c996e2b222d5581c53a0_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1919\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-9c81f8aa21447a8855612d5ffdfd67a3_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-02d7f29a3fc6c996e2b222d5581c53a0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-02d7f29a3fc6c996e2b222d5581c53a0_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1919\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"9zthoe1I\">V3 的参数已经多到吐血了。Anki 非常信任用户，相信用户能够知道调整参数意味着什么。</p><p data-pid=\"ziath39G\">SuperMemo 就很「独裁」了，只有一个参数可以调整：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-a96b454c56baa49c639de5fe0045bb1a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-84ed90a6562936d61c96db0b40d4d2a2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-84ed90a6562936d61c96db0b40d4d2a2_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1023\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-a96b454c56baa49c639de5fe0045bb1a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-84ed90a6562936d61c96db0b40d4d2a2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-84ed90a6562936d61c96db0b40d4d2a2_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1023\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"YWBUxmmJ\">哪一种更好？请参阅：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"aGcY7CRt\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/279553703\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">在 Anki 制作 2.9 万张卡片，复习 33 万次之后，我转用了 SuperMemo</a></li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-5\">卡片来源：批量制卡 vs 渐进阅读</h3><p data-pid=\"vb0xuwIv\">Anki 提供了各种批量制卡的途径。什么 txt 导入、csv 导入，还有牌组分享平台。</p><p data-pid=\"4_TR-zXn\">SuperMemo 直接没有内容分享平台。在制卡上，SuperMemo 推荐通过渐进阅读的两大利器（摘录、挖空）来生成卡片，并逐步优化知识表述。</p><p data-pid=\"gFvhICel\">哪一种更好？请参阅：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"WoUjuH7C\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"396775375\" href=\"#/post/396775375\">【翻译】单独的间隔重复记忆卡片是一种糟糕的交流媒介</a></li><li data-pid=\"d9_DFuRN\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"397271029\" href=\"#/post/397271029\">【翻译】学习别人的间隔重复记忆卡片通常是无效的</a></li><li data-pid=\"xmi0zniE\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"283017134\" href=\"#/post/283017134\">间隔重复中的简化与冗余</a></li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-6\">杂项</h3><p data-pid=\"fQTXD-h4\">Anki 中，评分按钮从左往右是</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"content_image\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-cfc2974e947d1d369e6a4b232d46368c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-919137776d3e0ea7587505ef4ce73a5c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-919137776d3e0ea7587505ef4ce73a5c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"388\"/></noscript><img class=\"content_image lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-cfc2974e947d1d369e6a4b232d46368c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-919137776d3e0ea7587505ef4ce73a5c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-919137776d3e0ea7587505ef4ce73a5c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"388\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"nRt8ffWE\">对应的快捷键是 1234</p><p data-pid=\"m--Kj1Na\">而 SuperMemo 是</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-f838c2497bc274314bdbf8b6ae15b874\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-f838c2497bc274314bdbf8b6ae15b874_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"516\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-f838c2497bc274314bdbf8b6ae15b874\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-f838c2497bc274314bdbf8b6ae15b874_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"516\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"iz7uUakM\">顺序上正好反过来</p><h2 id=\"sec-7\">理念角度</h2><h3 id=\"sec-8\">复习工具 vs 学习工具</h3><p data-pid=\"vgueriET\">Anki 本质上就是一个复习工具，Remember Anything。其抽认卡+牌组的结构让它很难在学习阶段起到什么作用。学习者终究还是得先在别处，看看书，做做笔记，然后制作卡片来复习。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-f000682df7f6d46c352916c30aa192fa_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-73c199089e029fae3a5ea029f00a4457\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-73c199089e029fae3a5ea029f00a4457_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"841\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-f000682df7f6d46c352916c30aa192fa_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-73c199089e029fae3a5ea029f00a4457\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-73c199089e029fae3a5ea029f00a4457_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"841\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"s2myy7Pr\">而 SuperMemo，则是一整套学习工具。渐进阅读、间隔重复、语义复习、渐进写作……作者的野心很大，软件的个人色彩也非常浓厚。里面甚至集成了睡眠分析工具和任务管理模块（虽然我都不会用）。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-cf36eb25e9423ce41495ac8f258ed625_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-0581c16459f4fb5374fa4fb1e0d6014b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-0581c16459f4fb5374fa4fb1e0d6014b_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"979\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-cf36eb25e9423ce41495ac8f258ed625_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-0581c16459f4fb5374fa4fb1e0d6014b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-0581c16459f4fb5374fa4fb1e0d6014b_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"979\"/></figure><h3 id=\"sec-9\">颜值万岁 vs 实用主义</h3><p data-pid=\"BOu4l8gZ\">Anki 的模板丰富程度和颜值水平应该不用我介绍了。当然，这也导致很多人把精力浪费在怎么把卡片做好看上：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-44554f2c17e43d9e4e6085193e3718ac_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-2ef0cb77398f29b0c5cdca805d35e67d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-2ef0cb77398f29b0c5cdca805d35e67d_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"987\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-44554f2c17e43d9e4e6085193e3718ac_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-2ef0cb77398f29b0c5cdca805d35e67d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-2ef0cb77398f29b0c5cdca805d35e67d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"987\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"sUPfDiLU\">SuperMemo。。。你懂得，不可能改好看的，呵呵呵呵。另外 woz 警告我们，要做学习上的完美主义，而不是卡片样式的完美主义：</p><blockquote data-pid=\"swOzhpP3\">如果你深入了解渐进学习之后，就会得出与之相反的结论：<b>完美主义者应该热爱渐进学习！</b>你的完美主义天性应该遵守最重要的原则：在最短的时间内获得最高质量的知识。重要的不是你集合中卡片的美观性，而是你头脑中知识的完美性。<br/><br/>如果你仍然不能忍受不完美的卡片，那就专心将他们美化吧。没有什么能阻止它们变得完美，这些完美的卡片可能备受你的喜爱，但你的学习速度肯定也会降低了。<br/><br/>来源：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.yuque.com/supermemo/wiki/il_for_perfectionists\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">完美主义者的渐进学习 · 语雀 (yuque.com)</a></blockquote><h3 id=\"sec-10\">填鸭式 vs 自助餐</h3><p data-pid=\"66xYzPAC\">Anki 的复习源源不断，每天都往你嘴里填卡片，要是哪天你没有清空当日的复习安排，卡片就会一直堆积下去。从导入到删库对 Ankier 来说司空见惯了。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-60e8ab9a2bc551ea7eb17774ef8df892_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-3a7b068ede953e76ab5e33e18ad0bd0b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-3a7b068ede953e76ab5e33e18ad0bd0b_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"675\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-60e8ab9a2bc551ea7eb17774ef8df892_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-3a7b068ede953e76ab5e33e18ad0bd0b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-3a7b068ede953e76ab5e33e18ad0bd0b_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"675\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"FIoQA5Iu\">SuperMemo 就很 free-style 了，优先级、自动推迟、提前复习，想吃多少吃多少，总有一样你爱吃的菜。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"content_image\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-98582b2c1cfafa01c1f72c31bc0ce3ad_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-343af3d47728312452cf92860cd042fd\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-343af3d47728312452cf92860cd042fd_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"398\"/></noscript><img class=\"content_image lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-98582b2c1cfafa01c1f72c31bc0ce3ad_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-343af3d47728312452cf92860cd042fd\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-343af3d47728312452cf92860cd042fd_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"398\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-4ed0f906f0c7a78c188fece1e0dc27b9_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-d72e6a6f5077deaa7f67176a817cf814\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-d72e6a6f5077deaa7f67176a817cf814_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"455\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-4ed0f906f0c7a78c188fece1e0dc27b9_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-d72e6a6f5077deaa7f67176a817cf814\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-d72e6a6f5077deaa7f67176a817cf814_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"455\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"ArfeNqsj\">哪一种好？请参阅：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"tk5MtdqB\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/364351955\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">渐进阅读：卡片刷不完？拥抱优先级！</a></li></ul><hr/><p data-pid=\"CwBR0ajF\">写不动了，其他群友来补充一下吧。 <a class=\"member_mention\" data-hash=\"0a95419f5dafdedf6ba306df39df7210\" data-hovercard=\"p$b$0a95419f5dafdedf6ba306df39df7210\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/people/0a95419f5dafdedf6ba306df39df7210\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@外接式赛博格</a> </p><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 彼得 · 沃兹尼亚克 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"303204832\" href=\"#/post/303204832\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"303204832","title":"彼得 · 沃兹尼亚克","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":70,"minutes":9,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"322584755","title":"【翻译】SuperMemo 中渐进阅读的意义：第二部分","author":"Master How To Learn","votes":61,"minutes":10,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"283017134","title":"间隔重复中的简化与冗余","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":53,"minutes":3,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"360416156","title":"死记硬背（填鸭式学习）","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":49,"minutes":1,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"397271029","title":"学习别人的间隔重复记忆卡片通常是无效的","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":22,"minutes":1,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"279166945","title":"间隔效应","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":21,"minutes":3,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"289631499","title":"量子物理学家用 Anki 重新发现渐进阅读","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":101,"minutes":11,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"372072085","title":"渐进阅读的最小定义","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":45,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"322673517","title":"示范：我的渐进阅读工作流程","author":"Master How To Learn","votes":207,"minutes":11,"reason":"延伸深读 · Master How To Learn"},{"id":"307602868","title":"水蛭（Leech）[Anki, SuperMemo]","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":16,"minutes":1,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"315758950","title":"谬误：SuperMemo 的重复会浪费太多时间","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":32,"minutes":1,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"2271842801","title":"SuperMemo 是如何安排阅读时间的？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":85,"minutes":4,"reason":"相似问答 · 85 赞同"},{"id":"1956131449","title":"请问marginnote和anki的组合能否实现渐进阅读？并且使用anki相对超期程筛选进行复习？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":19,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 19 赞同"},{"id":"3172266680","title":"在Anki已经有了FSRS这种新的算法后，如何通过Anki做渐进阅读？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":368,"minutes":8,"reason":"相似问答 · 368 赞同"},{"id":"1872145962","title":"如何评价RemNote这款笔记应用，值得一试吗？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":211,"minutes":4,"reason":"相似问答 · 211 赞同"},{"id":"1745941223","title":"如何评价Piotr Wozniak博士？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":19,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 19 赞同"}]}